WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:05.050
All of the titles in this trailer are written
over these graphics, that resemble the Rorschach

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:08.500
test, which is used by psychologists to make
determinations about their patients based

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.270
on what they think they see first in the inkblots.

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:14.970
If you want to hear about the secret images
hidden in these inkblots then stick around

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:16.640
to the end of this video.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:20.680
[Intro]

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.020
It’s a Decemberween miracle!

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:26.599
We got a new horror trailer on Decemberween.

00:00:26.599 --> 00:00:28.340
What a generous gift from Peele.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.470
Bring it in Peele.

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:30.470
Bring it in.

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:33.990
Alright, so this trailer starts off with the
family in the car, going to the beach and

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:36.140
listening to the song “I Got 5 on It”.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:40.730
The kid asks what that means and the daughter
tells him about drugs, but then the father

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:41.730
tells him,

00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:43.289
“It’s not about drugs, it’s a dope song.

00:00:43.289 --> 00:00:44.289
Don’t do drugs.”

00:00:44.289 --> 00:00:48.199
Now I’m not really an affianado on hip-hop,
unless we’re talking about lo-fi, so I had

00:00:48.199 --> 00:00:51.829
to look this one up, and according my research
HE’S A LIAR.

00:00:51.829 --> 00:00:54.149
The dad lied to his son.

00:00:54.149 --> 00:00:55.679
About the meaning of this song.

00:00:55.679 --> 00:00:59.480
But one of the things we’ve all been wondering
about Us before the trailer came out, was

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:03.680
if this one is going to be more of a straight
horror flick, or lean more towards comedy.

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:05.439
And it looks to be more on the serious side.

00:01:05.439 --> 00:01:09.570
You’ve even got the son wearing a Jaws shirt,
and not only that, but wearing it to the beach.

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:12.520
He’s also got this Wolfman mask, I think
that’s what it is.

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:15.850
And the girl that we meet later is wearing
a Michael Jackson “Thriller” t-shirt,

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:19.750
which of course, has a music video known for
a depiction of a werewolf movie at the beginning.

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:23.320
Or maybe it’s most known for spawning this
meme now, but hopefully not.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:27.680
So the son wanders off at the beach, encounters
a spooky guy who’s T-posing?

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:30.930
Dude you don’t need to be t-posing, you
already have blood on your hands.

00:01:30.930 --> 00:01:34.270
But that’s actually not the only point in
the trailer that this happens, because the

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:36.990
son of the clone family is also seen doing
it.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:40.360
See, even horror villains can do it for the
meme sometimes.

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.509
These dopplegangers of the original family,
take over the house and they appear to be

00:01:43.509 --> 00:01:45.329
evil versions of the main characters.

00:01:45.329 --> 00:01:49.130
But in addition to this family, there is also
a duplicate of this little girl, this boat

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:52.850
towards the beginning of the trailer is not
the same as the one seen later on in the dark,

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:56.200
and when they’re initially walking to the
beach, their long shadows represent a dark

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:57.770
version of themselves.

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:01.350
Since they have a dark version of themselves,
they may also be the next hit Nintendo franchise.

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:05.450
In fact, if you pause one minute and fifty-three
seconds into the trailer, you can clearly

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:09.190
see Mario is standing there, holding hands
with one of the doppelgangers.

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:10.800
This one’s called scissors Mario.

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:14.750
The hand-holding is also seen in this classroom
scene with a bunch of stick figures holding

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:15.750
hands on the chalkboard.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:19.730
The handprints here below the chalkboard are
reminiscent of a Kindergarten art project

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:23.920
type of thing, but in this case they’re
all red, a reminder of the bloody-handed t-posing

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:24.880
guy from before.

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:27.040
We get it dude, we get it!

00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:30.269
The other notable thing for me in this shot
is the woman holding these cutouts up like

00:02:30.269 --> 00:02:31.300
bunny ears.

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:33.739
There are a lot of references to magic in
this trailer.

00:02:33.739 --> 00:02:37.110
Rabbits are usually associated with magic,
because magicians are always trying to pull

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:38.460
a rabbit out of a hat for some reason.

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:41.840
The daughter’s got a rabbit on her shirt
at the lake, the doppelganger son sits like

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:45.540
a rabbit, there’s a hall full of rabbits,
and a fight that takes place in a room full

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:46.540
of caged rabbits.

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:50.370
The title card has a Rorschach test where
the middle white part looks like a rabbit’s

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.409
face looking straight at you.

00:02:51.409 --> 00:02:53.420
We’ll come back to the rest of this though.

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:56.920
Another possible reason for all of the rabbits
other than the magic reference, is that rabbits

00:02:56.920 --> 00:03:01.069
are known to quickly reproduce and the antagonists
of this movie seem to be reproductions of

00:03:01.069 --> 00:03:02.160
the main family.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:05.379
When the son wanders off, he goes towards
an attraction called Merlin’s Forest.

00:03:05.379 --> 00:03:09.480
There is also a painting of a fox on the side
of that building, a natural predator of rabbits

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:12.640
and in this scene in the closet there is a
board game called Magic.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:15.810
So those are the definite magic references,
and then there’s also a shot here of the

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:18.930
daughter on this cracked mirror, which makes
me think of people sometimes referring to

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:20.720
magic tricks as smoke and mirrors.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:25.280
But the mirrors could have a different meaning,
since the doppelgangers are like mirror images

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.280
of the original characters.

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:29.670
And that’s where I’m gonna get into the
inkblot stuff.

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:31.250
Most of them are mirrored down the center.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:34.549
I think this one looks like the son’s Wolfman
mask a little bit.

00:03:34.549 --> 00:03:37.700
Maybe a little bit more like Chewbacca actually,
but they’re both pretty close.

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:39.180
In this one I see a skull.

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:41.970
And in this one I’m getting a creepy pair
of eyes with a mask.

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:43.489
Maybe a little Sub-Zero going on there.

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:45.640
The final title card is the most interesting.

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:49.750
I pointed out the rabbit already, but this
could also be interpreted as the handle of

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:52.390
the scissors seen throughout the trailer and
poster.

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:56.490
Then there are two faces looking outward,
but this is the only title graphic that doesn’t

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:57.769
have perfect symmetry.

00:03:57.769 --> 00:04:01.670
Let me know what you saw in each of those
Rorschach tests though, those are always interesting

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.720
to hear what people saw.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.349
Wait… hold on, hold on…

00:04:05.349 --> 00:04:06.879
I think I see something....

00:04:06.879 --> 00:04:13.800
Yes, it appears to say… subscribe to CZsWorld
for new horrors every week, ring that deathbell

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:17.880
for notifications and I’ll see you in the
next one.

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:19.360
Assuming we both survive.

